      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火立啊，\n這企畫太讚啦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B7ACB554AFF0C000A90194F01756B592A8B9A556630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "汗……我的汗……\n我的汗……流不停……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C5720262026621176846C5720262026000A621176846C57202620266D414E0D505C202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我且來確認一下，\n這辣度是否值得一試。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E144F8678BA8A8D4E004E0BFF0C000A90198FA35EA6662F5426503C5F974E008A6630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "儘管放辣過來吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51187BA1653E8FA3904E4F865427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這精華散發出的刺激氣味\n讓我的攻擊力節節高昇！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90197CBE83EF6563767C51FA7684523A6FC06C235473000A8B9362117684653B64CA529B7BC07BC09AD86607FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "直衝腦頂啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F4885D816698025566FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這辣度……這是怎麼回事！\n我內心的火焰被點燃了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90198FA35EA6202620269019662F600E9EBC56DE4E8BFF01000A621151675FC37684706B713088AB9EDE71C34E86300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不錯不錯……\n也許該推出辣味卡娜莉麵包。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D932F4E0D932F20262026000A4E5F8A318A7263A851FA8FA3547353615A1C83899EB55305300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿8",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們是一家人來享受\n刺激美食的！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115011662F4E005BB64EBA4F864EAB53D7000A523A6FC07F8E98DF7684FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我就是不喜歡吃辣啊……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C31662F4E0D559C6B6154038FA3554A202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刺激，即是頂級！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "523A6FC0FF0C5373662F98027D1AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然用辣度來一決勝負，\n這美食節太讓我好奇了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF713675288FA35EA64F864E006C7A52DD8CA0FF0C000A90197F8E98DF7BC0592A8B936211597D59474E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這也太猛啦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E5F592A731B5566FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太刺激了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A523A6FC04E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘔……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "561420262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讚啦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9A5566FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "驚為天辣♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9A5A70BA59298FA3266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿B",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託啦，狠辣椒，\n大把灑上精華吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A175566FF0C72E08FA36912FF0C000A5927628A70514E0A7CBE83EF542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "幸福，來自辛辣。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E78798FFF0C4F8681EA8F9B8FA330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣過頭的話，\n只會覺得痛呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA3904E982D76848A71FF0C000A53EA670389BA5F9775DB546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看你們能不能滿足\n我這個評辣師吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F60501180FD4E0D80FD6EFF8DB3000A62119019500B8A558FA35E2B542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小辣♪小辣♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F8FA3266A5C0F8FA3266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "狠辣椒！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72E08FA36912FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "狠辣椒，你太棒了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72E08FA36912FF0C4F60592A68D24E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這辣度，\n簡直是人間天堂！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90198FA35EA6FF0C000A7C2176F4662F4EBA959359295802FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哪是辣，根本就是痛啊！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 3632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54EA662F8FA3FF0C6839672C5C31662F75DB554AFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "隱約有種果香呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96B17D0467097A2E679C9999546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇喔！\n湧上一股莫名的活力來了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 3680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C75594FF01000A6E674E0A4E0080A183AB540D76846D3B529B4F864E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿N",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我全身沐浴在\n辣椒精華下吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 3728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B93621151688EAB6C906D745728000A8FA369127CBE83EF4E0B5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣椒精華！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 3760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA369127CBE83EFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在體驗這輩子\n前所未有的恐怖辛辣！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 3772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B6357289AD49A5790198F295B50000A524D6240672A67097684605060168F9B8FA3FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿R",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 3812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00520000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "俺的胃是鐵打的，\n管你多辣都OK的啦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4FFA768480C3662F943562537684FF0C000A7BA14F60591A8FA390FD004F004B76845566FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不太喜歡辣的東西。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 3864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D592A559C6B618FA376846771897F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣椒精華進到眼裡了！\n果然是狂暴凶狠的狠辣椒！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 3888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA369127CBE83EF90325230773C88E14E86FF01000A679C7136662F72C266B451F672E0768472E08FA36912FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "俺的胃要翻出來啦……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 3936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4FFA768480C389817FFB51FA4F865566202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "天～明明辣過頭了，\n手還是停不下來。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 3960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5929FF5E660E660E8FA3904E982D4E86FF0C000A624B9084662F505C4E0D4E0B4F8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿X",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 4000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00580000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來個大辣，謝謝♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F86500B59278FA3FF0C8B1D8B1D266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來了！來了！來了！\n來了！來了！辣椒精華！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 4032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F864E86FF014F864E86FF014F864E86FF01000A4F864E86FF014F864E86FF018FA369127CBE83EFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉喲～太甜啦。\n有點失望耶。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 4076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "550955B2FF5E592A751C55663002000A67099EDE5931671B803630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\\",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 4108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF005C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火辣美食節，\n能否成為密阿雷的特色呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 4120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B8FA37F8E98DF7BC0FF0C000A80FD5426621070BA5BC6963F96F77684727982725462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是讓我失望，\n是會變一星餐館的！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 94,
      "offsetInSection": 4160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F8B9362115931671BFF0C000A662F67038B8A4E00661F991099287684FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多麼熱情的招式！\n辣椒素測量指標要突破上限了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 95,
      "offsetInSection": 4196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A9EBC71B160C5768462DB5F0FFF01000A8FA369127D206E2C91CF63076A1989817A8178344E0A96504E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火辣狠狠地直衝頭頂。\n火辣美食節真是夠頂極。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 4244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B8FA372E072E0573076F4885D982D98023002000A706B8FA37F8E98DF7BC0771F662F59209802697530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我看這貳流\n要晉升三星的日子不遠了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 97,
      "offsetInSection": 4292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211770B90198CB36D41000A8981664953474E09661F768465E55B504E0D90604E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿b",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 98,
      "offsetInSection": 4332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我很容易吃壞肚子，\n但我想挑戰看看。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 99,
      "offsetInSection": 4344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713662115F885BB96613540358DE809A5B50FF0C000A4F46621160F363116230770B770B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辣椒精華這火焰般的色澤，\n光用看的，肚子就痛起來了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 100,
      "offsetInSection": 4388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FA369127CBE83EF9019706B7130822C768482726FA4FF0C000A51497528770B7684FF0C809A5B505C3175DB8D774F864E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這辣味真是絕頂，\n但我可能得閉關在廁所裡了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 101,
      "offsetInSection": 4444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90198FA35473771F662F7D559802FF0C000A4F46621153EF80FD5F97958995DC57285EC1624088E14E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿f",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 102,
      "offsetInSection": 4492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "狠辣椒……有點恐怖，\n我其實不太想靠近牠。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 103,
