      "offsetInSection": 4592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E0B62118981611B4E0A000A72E08FA369124E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "光聞著香味，就要流眼淚了！\n狠辣椒，愛你喔。",
