      "offsetInSection": 4668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF006C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火辣美食節\n真是個瘋狂的派對。",
